- `Customers`: `customer_id`, `name`, `city`, `country`
- `Orders`: `order_id`, `customer_id`, `order_date`, `total_amount`
- `Products`: `product_id`, `name`, `price`
- `Order_Items`: `order_id`, `product_id`, `quantity`

